  <!-- -->

  1. Endogenous creatinine clearance ≥ 50 mL/min, or creatinine ≤ 1.5 × ULN (using the Cockcroft-Gault formula);
  2. Alanine aminotransferase (ALT) and aspartate aminotransferase (AST) ≤ 3 × ULN, total bilirubin ≤ 1.5 × ULN; If hepatobiliary involvement: AST and ALT ≤ 5 × ULN, total bilirubin ≤ 3.0 × ULN;
